Home Connect (Bosch, Siemens, Neff) appliances are discovered automatically. A power monitor named for a washing machine, dryer, dishwasher or oven, such as a "Washing machine" smart plug, is offered as *Discovered*, to check the threshold before it's added. Any other appliance on a power monitor can be set up manually once the installation is complete.
